50°C 323.15 0.02785 -30.16 $8.0 \times 10^{-14}$
60°C 333.15 0.02871 -29.26 $1.9 \times 10^{-13}$
70°C 343.15 0.02957 -28.40 $4.6 \times 10^{-13}$
75°C 348.15 0.03000 -28.00 $6.9 \times 10^{-13}$
