\text{CI}_{95\%} = \bar\pi \pm 1.96 \times \frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{n}},

where $\sigma$ is the standard deviation across runs and $n = 200$. With $\bar\pi = 0.022$ and $\sigma = 0.018$, the interval is

