This suggests that localized hot spots are negligible for the estimated power densities. However, this calculation assumes uniform heat spreading and does not account for the lower thermal conductivity of the buried oxide in FD-SOI. A more detailed thermal simulation would be required to accurately characterize hot-spot temperatures.

